{{!
  A use case's result when it ends in more than one way: a sealed interface with one record per case, so the caller's
  switch has to cover them all. Exemplar: account-usecase RegisterCustomerOutcome.
  Target: <capability>-usecase/src/main/java/<package path>/usecase/<Name>Outcome.java
  Package: "package" is the base package, without the ".usecase" this template appends (com.example.guest renders
          package com.example.guest.usecase); <package path> is that base as a path. scripts/scaffold.sh refuses a
          target outside the directory of the package the file declares.
  Vars:   package, Name, imports (optional, fully qualified), cases[Case, fields[type, name, last] (none for a case
          that carries nothing)]
  Types use triple braces so generics are not HTML-escaped.
}}
package {{package}}.usecase;
